<title>GERMANY: Trinkaus to pay 13 mark 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus to pay 13 mark 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend					 13    vs 12   marks</p>
<p>    Distributable profit		    33.9 million vs 28.2 million</p>
<p>Dividend will be paid after annual meeting on June 17, 1996.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the bank is Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt. The bank said its distributable profit rose sharply due to a capital rise during the year due to the conversion of options. The company's capital rose to 130.5 million marks from 117.5 million marks.</p>
</text>
